 * scripts/lib/pane-adapter.ts
 *
 * CH-2 — provider-neutral PaneAdapter implementations for mixed-host tmux teams.
 *
 * Contract (BY POINTER): <HIGH_ENTROPY_REDACTED>-cross-host-orchestration.md
